[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274183976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110377#issuecomment-3274183976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110377","id":3274183976,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DKBUo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-10T09:47:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T09:47:24Z","body":"This doesn't look like a bug, resizing queues a resort and draws, so it will draw, then resort, and queue another draw\n\nI assume the specific detail is the order of the sort and draw calls happening ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274183976/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274217390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110377#issuecomment-3274217390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110377","id":3274217390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DKJeu","user":{"login":"AtlasDjinn","id":65500959,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTAwOTU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65500959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn","html_url":"https://github.com/AtlasDjinn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-10T09:57:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T09:57:37Z","body":"I assumed that it is a bug because the description for _draw() says that it only happens after queue_redraw() has been called either manually or by the engine, and queue_redraw()'s description says \"This only occurs once per frame, even if this method has been called multiple times.\"","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274217390/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274299210","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110377#issuecomment-3274299210","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110377","id":3274299210,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DKddK","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-10T10:21:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T10:21:49Z","body":"Absolutely, but in this situation it looks like it doesn't call it multiple times in a frame, but rather in the end of the frame, in this case it triggers `queue_redraw`, then `queue_sort`, so it draws, then it sorts, so when the `sort_children` signal is triggered it has already finished drawing, so it starts a new call for it ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274299210/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274345523","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110377#issuecomment-3274345523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110377","id":3274345523,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DKowz","user":{"login":"AtlasDjinn","id":65500959,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTAwOTU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65500959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn","html_url":"https://github.com/AtlasDjinn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtlasDjinn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-10T10:35:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T10:35:20Z","body":"I see, `sort_children` calls `queue_redraw()` at the end of the current frame, after it has already been drawn, but due to changes in the current frame caused by sorting, it draws the current frame a second time to take changes into account, instead of showing a non-sorted frame.\n\nI now see the logic behind this behavior, I initially assumed that it would queue a redraw for the next frame, instead of the current one, but that would show a non-sorted frame, which we typically don't want to happen.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274345523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274364477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110377#issuecomment-3274364477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110377","id":3274364477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DKtY9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-10T10:41:58Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T10:41:58Z","body":"It would be difficult to solve reliably and not fire additional issues to handle it \"properly\" not firing drawing multiple times, it's handled by simply adding a deferred call at the end of the current frame, once that call is done it will clear the flag telling it to not queue any more draw calls\n\nThis behavior might cause crashes in some cases, could be related to:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/82033\n\nIt might be possible to rearrange some things to make sorting occur before drawing, but only specifically for resizing etc. not in general ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274364477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]